WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.870
Take your index finger and your thumb and
lightly grip the base of your tail and run

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:08.630
your fingers along the length of your tail.

00:00:08.630 --> 00:00:10.070
You mean stroke it?

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:12.230
Nobody used that word. This is not a stroking motion.

00:00:12.230 --> 00:00:15.440
This is a completely non-sexual thing I am
asking you to do.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:17.450
In a completely non-sexual way.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:23.780
Squeeze the base of the tail lightly with
your thumb and index finger, and then, while

00:00:23.780 --> 00:00:29.210
continuing to squeeze, run them up the length
of your tail to the tip,

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:30.710
and I'll make you a clone.

00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:32.450
I only have to do it once?

00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:34.010
I'll tell you when to stop.

00:00:37.940 --> 00:00:40.850
I don't know why you're stopping. Nobody told
you to stop.

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:47.660
Give me a little smile. Your lips look a
little dry.

00:00:47.660 --> 00:00:48.950
Why don't you wet them a little bit?

00:00:52.090 --> 00:00:54.670
My God, you're so weird!

